<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Git on ianhuang筆記</title><link>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/tags/git/</link><description>Recent content in Git on ianhuang筆記</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://iankingh.github.io/blog/tags/git/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>GitHub／GitLab Issue 管理：提報指南、Markdown 錨點與 Issue 範本</title><link>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/github-gitlab-issue-management/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/github-gitlab-issue-management/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;收到 Bug 回報時，最常需要追問的是版本、操作步驟，以及實際結果。可以在專案放一份「提報 Issue 前請先看」指南，用 Markdown 錨點和表格引導讀者選對範本，再由範本提示要填哪些資訊。原始案例把 Bug 回報、功能建議和一般討論導向不同入口。&lt;a href="https://github.com/xingkongliang/skills-manager/issues/155" rel="noopener external nofollow noreferrer" target="_blank" class="exturl"&gt;skills-manager 的置頂 Issue #155&lt;span class="external-mark" aria-hidden="true"&gt;↗&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;（另開新視窗）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Git 匯出版本差異：固定目標提交並保留空白路徑</title><link>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/git-export-diff-file/</link><pubDate>Wed, 23 Feb 2022 18:13:27 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/git-export-diff-file/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;補齊從兩個版本匯出改動檔案的可靠指令碼，排除刪除檔並記錄刪除清單。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Git 基本流程：檢查、暫存與提交</title><link>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/git-command/</link><pubDate>Wed, 14 Jul 2021 09:21:29 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/git-command/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;補齊 status、diff、add、commit 的操作順序，區分工作目錄與暫存區。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Git 日常筆記：遠端、忽略規則與回復提交</title><link>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/git-note/</link><pubDate>Tue, 13 Jul 2021 22:07:36 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/git-note/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;重整易混淆指令，區分 revert、reset 與工作目錄還原。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Git 提交訊息：Conventional Commits 與拆分原則</title><link>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/git-commit-message/</link><pubDate>Thu, 04 Feb 2021 12:52:04 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/git-commit-message/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;修正 type、scope 的格式，提供繁體中文提交示例與不相容變更標示。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Git 分支同步：把主分支更新帶入工作分支</title><link>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/git-branch-update-master/</link><pubDate>Tue, 02 Feb 2021 22:04:27 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/git-branch-update-master/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;說明 fetch、fast-forward 與 merge 的差異，補上衝突處理及中止方式。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Git 排錯：本機修改阻擋切換與合併衝突</title><link>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/git-error/</link><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2020 21:45:42 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/git-error/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;以儲存修改為起點，補上 stash、衝突診斷與復原確認，移除無條件 hard reset 的建議。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>GitLab 認證失敗：HTTPS 憑證與 SSH 診斷</title><link>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/gitlab-error/</link><pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2020 16:36:13 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/gitlab-error/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;補上 token、認證快取與 SSH 的核對順序，區分 401、403、憑證和網路問題。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>